  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RAF: Funk for Life - L&#xE4;kare utan gr&#xE4;nser</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RAF: Funk for Life</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Funk for Life projektet lett av Nils Landgren, musiker, siktar p&#xE5; att st&#xF6;dja L&#xE4;kare utan gr&#xE4;nsers arbete i Khayelitsha, Kapstaden. Genom ett kulturutbyte mellan svenska musiker och ungdomar i Khayelitsha siktar projektet p&#xE5; att &#xF6;ka medvetandet kring fr&#xE5;gor som brist p&#xE5; tillg&#xE5;ng till god h&#xE4;lso- och sjukv&#xE5;rd f&#xF6;r de mest utsatta.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funk for Life- By Nils Landgren, musician, aims at supporting the Medecins Sans Frontieres work in Khayelitsha, Cape Town. Through a cultural exchange between Swedish musicians and youth in Khayelitsha the aim is to create awareness about the difficulties for acces to proper health care and treatment for the most vulnerable.</narrative>
  </description>
